      "text": "- Store the data with Room (SQLite)\n- Front-end with Jetpack Compose\n- Navigation between screens (NavController)\n- Child CRUD\n- Number of registered children\n- Search by the child's CPF\n- Search by the guardian's CPF\n- Average age of the children\n- Everything in English (code and texts)",
