      "text": "home  ->  child_form   (register)\nhome  ->  child_list\nhome  ->  search\nchild_list  ->  child_form   (edit)\n\nSelectedChild carries the child\nto the form (like the teacher's Translado):\n  - null   = register a new child\n  - child  = edit this child\n\nBack = navController.popBackStack()",
      "rawText": "home  ->  child_form   (register)\nhome  ->  child_list\nhome  ->  search\nchild_list  ->  child_form   (edit)\n\nSelectedChild carries the child\nto the form (like the teacher's Translado):\n  - null   = register a new child\n  - child  = edit this child\n\nBack = navController.popBackStack()",
      "originalText": "home  ->  child_form   (register)\nhome  ->  child_list\nhome  ->  search\nchild_list  ->  child_form   (edit)\n\nSelectedChild carries the child\nto the form (like the teacher's Translado):\n  - null   = register a new child\n  - child  = edit this child\n\nBack = navController.popBackStack()",
